OL,3,CCynthia Erivo joins Wicked co-star
OL,4,CAriana Grande for surprise O2 gig
OL,5,Cappearance
OL,7,FAriana Grande brought out Wicked co-
OL,8,Fstar Cynthia Erivo during the second
OL,9,Fnight of her O2 residency on Sunday.
OL,11,FErivo and Grande, who both received
OL,12,FOscar nominations for their
OL,13,Fperformances in the 2024 film before
OL,14,Freprising their respective roles as
OL,15,FElphaba Thropp and Galinda Upland in
OL,16,FWicked: For Good, performed For Good
OL,17,Fand Happy Days.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
