PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786933105
OL,3,CCynthia Erivo joins Wicked co-star
OL,4,CAriana Grande for surprise O2 gig
OL,5,Cappearance
OL,7,FAfter the show, the Thank U, Next
OL,8,Fsinger shared a clip of the two on
OL,9,Fstage together to her Instagram
OL,10,FStories, with a heart emoji.
OL,12,FEarlier, Grande thanked fans for their
OL,13,F"overwhelming" support as she began
OL,14,Fher O2 residency on Saturday following
OL,15,Fthe news that she is to step back from
OL,16,Fpublic life.
OL,18,FThis weekend's performances were the
OL,19,Ffirst of 10 nights at the north
OL,20,FGreenwich venue.
