OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786933105
OL,3,CCynthia Erivo joins Wicked co-star
OL,4,CAriana Grande for surprise O2 gig
OL,5,Cappearance
OL,7,FThe set drew heavily on Grande's 2024
OL,8,Falbum Eternal Sunshine with tracks
OL,9,Ffrom her latest album Petal, as well
OL,10,Fas her best-known hits such as Into
OL,11,FYou, Thank U, Next and 7 Rings, along
OL,12,Fwith a cover of Lady Gaga's Rain On Me.
OL,14,FGrande's elaborate staging saw her
OL,15,Fperform in a rundown house and the
OL,16,Flighting rig being transformed into a
OL,17,Fpolice helicopter, while Grande waved
OL,18,Fand blew kisses to fans throughout.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
