PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786933105
OL,3,CCynthia Erivo joins Wicked co-star
OL,4,CAriana Grande for surprise O2 gig
OL,5,Cappearance
OL,7,FVideos breaking up each act of the
OL,8,Fperformance gave the concert a
OL,9,Fcinematic feel, which was added to by
OL,10,FErivo's appearance on Sunday.
OL,12,FThe show comes after Grande announced
OL,13,Flast month that she would take a step
OL,14,Fback from the spotlight after she
OL,15,Fcompletes the residency, which will
OL,16,Fbring an end to her Eternal Sunshine
OL,17,Ftour.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
