OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786933105
OL,3,CCynthia Erivo joins Wicked co-star
OL,4,CAriana Grande for surprise O2 gig
OL,5,Cappearance
OL,7,FSpeaking on stage at an earlier gig on
OL,8,Fthe tour, Grande said her decision to
OL,9,Ftake a break from public life came
OL,10,Ffrom "a thoughtful and empowered
OL,11,Fplace" and was "not a reactive or
OL,12,Fimpulsive thing".
OL,14,FShe has also dropped out of the
OL,15,Fupcoming London revival of the Stephen
OL,16,FSondheim musical Sunday In The Park
OL,17,FWith George, in which she was due to
OL,18,Fappear opposite Wicked co-star
OL,19,FJonathan Bailey. Her role is due to be
OL,20,Frecast.
