OL,3,CCynthia Erivo joins Wicked co-star
OL,4,CAriana Grande for surprise O2 gig
OL,5,Cappearance
OL,7,FPetal became Grande's sixth
OL,8,Fconsecutive number one album last
OL,9,Fweek, following Dangerous Woman
OL,10,F(2016), Sweetener (2018), Thank U,
OL,11,FNext (2019), Positions (2020) and
OL,12,FEternal Sunshine.
